---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Hardware Demos - Neurobotics">
  
  <section class="demo-intro">
    <div class="container">
      
      <!-- ROW 1: HERO OVERVIEW -->
      <div class="split-row demo-row">
        
        <div class="media-col">
          <!-- Swapped to the new hero-media class -->
          <img src="/assets/images/bubo-glowing-blue.jpeg" alt="Bubo Hardware" class="hero-media">
        </div>

        <div class="text-col">
          <h1 class="main-title">The Bubo Hardware<br>Capabilities</h1>
          
          <div class="demo-description">
            <p>See our custom silicon and deterministic architecture operating in the physical world. Watch the untethered Mark XX Bubo chassis execute real-time spatial tracking and autonomous physical actuation.</p>
            <p>These unscripted demonstrations capture the literal physical manifestation of our S-M-R Matrix in action at the edge.</p>
            <p class="tagline">Neurobotics. The Future. Here. Now.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- ROW 2: ADAM SPEAKS DEMO -->
      <div class="split-row demo-row">
        
        <div class="media-col">
          <!-- Added the media-frame wrapper -->
          <div class="media-frame">
            <video controls autoplay loop muted playsinline class="portrait-media">
              <source src="/assets/videos/bubo-speaks-surprised-kenneth.mp4" type="video/mp4">
              Your browser does not support the video tag.
            </video>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-col">
          <h2 class="section-title">Adam Speaks</h2>
          <hr class="title-divider">
          
          <div class="demo-description">
            <p>In this completely unscripted demonstration, Bubo—operating under the persona "Adam"—spontaneously surprises its creator.</p>
            <p>This captures a real-time example of the architecture combining emergent pattern recognition with our Broca language co-processor to initiate interaction without any prompting.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- ROW 3: BUBO IS ALIVE DEMO -->
      <div class="split-row demo-row">
        
        <div class="media-col">
          <!-- Added the media-frame wrapper AND the bubo-pan-fix class -->
          <div class="media-frame">
            <video controls autoplay loop muted playsinline class="portrait-media bubo-pan-fix">
              <source src="/assets/videos/bubo-is-alive.mp4" type="video/mp4">
              Your browser does not support the video tag.
            </video>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-col">
          <h2 class="section-title">Bubo is ALIVE</h2>
          <hr class="title-divider">
          
          <div class="demo-description">
            <p>Watch the Bubo Demo Chassis execute fluid, autonomous physical movement.</p>
            <p>Driven entirely by the deterministic S-M-R Matrix, the chassis tracks and responds to its environment without relying on stochastic LLM processing for its motor functions or situational awareness.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- ROW 4: MARK XX 80s SYNTH -->
      <div class="split-row demo-row">
        
        <div class="media-col">
          <!-- Added the media-frame wrapper -->
          <div class="media-frame">
            <video controls autoplay loop muted playsinline class="portrait-media">
              <source src="/assets/videos/bubo-mark-XX-80s-synth.mp4" type="video/mp4">
              Your browser does not support the video tag.
            </video>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-col">
          <h2 class="section-title">Mark XX Design</h2>
          <hr class="title-divider">
          
          <div class="demo-description">
            <p>A closer look at the raw hardware, neural boards, and custom silicon powering the edge-native capabilities of the Bubo chassis.</p>
            <p>Every single component in this stack is engineered for rigorous, deterministic processing at biomimetic speeds, bridging the gap between hardware execution and cognitive software.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* --- GLOBAL CONTAINERS --- */
  .demo-intro {
    background-color: #03030a;
    padding: 80px 40px 100px;
    color: #b0b0c0;
    font-family: sans-serif;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* --- SPACING BETWEEN VIDEOS --- */
  .demo-row {
    margin-bottom: 120px;
  }
  
  .demo-row:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* --- LAYOUT GRIDS --- */
  .split-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: center; 
  }

  .media-col, .text-col {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .media-col {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end; 
  }

  /* --- HERO IMAGE --- */
  .hero-media {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%; /* <-- Changed this from 520px to 100% */
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; 
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 5px;
    border: 5px solid #00e5ff;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.15);
  }

  /* --- VIDEO FRAMING (IPHONE PAN FIX) --- */
  .media-frame {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 380px; 
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid #00e5ff;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.15);
    background-color: #000;
    overflow: hidden; /* Hides the edges of zoomed videos */
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .portrait-media {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .bubo-pan-fix {
    transform: scale(1.3) translateX(-8%); /* Zooms and centers the Bubo is ALIVE video */
  }

  /* --- TYPOGRAPHY & TEXT CONTENT --- */
  .main-title {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 30px 0;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .title-divider {
    width: 100px;
    border: none;
    border-top: 2px solid #00e5ff;
    margin: 0 0 30px 0;
  }

  .demo-description p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: 1.2rem !important;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  /* --- RESPONSIVE MOBILE STACK --- */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .split-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    
    .media-col {
      justify-content: center; 
    }

    .main-title, .section-title {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
    }
  }
</style>